using UnityEngine;

/// <summary>DATA-DRIVEN car model map — the single place that decides which
/// 3D model a roster car uses (car index -&gt; model). A later pass swaps a
/// car by changing THIS FILE's data only; CarVisuals.cs needs no edits.
///
/// Resolution order per car (CarModelMap.Resolve):
///   1. DETAILED model at Resources/Models/Cars/&lt;CarNameNoSpaces&gt; — the
///      Sketchfab hook. The pipeline agent lands decimated (&lt;50k tris)
///      Sketchfab FBX prefabs there; when one exists for a car it is used
///      automatically (CarVisuals, CarMeetManager and ShowcaseGarageManager
///      all load this path). No code change needed when a detailed model
///      lands.
///   2. KENNEY stand-in at Resources/Models/Kenney/CarKit/&lt;style&gt; —
///      the CC0 body-style closest match below. Real imported models,
///      stylised low-poly (~2k tris, flat colours): a genuine step up
///      from procedural boxes, but NOT AAA-detailed.
///
/// Cars with a verified exact free CC-BY Sketchfab model (ModelSources.md
/// §4 — these slots get detailed models first): 14 Porscha 911, 17
/// McLarren 720S, 27 Ferrarri LaFerrarri, 28 Huracan, 29 Countach,
/// 32 Paganii Huayra, 33 Bpcati Chiron, 38 MSAIN R34 GT, 39 Toyata Supra,
/// 41 Mazdza RX-7 (alt), 51 Toyata GR Supra Final. Five more via ModVision
/// credits (URL to confirm): 18 McLarren P2, 20 Mustang GT, 23 Challenger,
/// 42 WRX STI, 44 Silvia S15. Indices 0-7 are the original cars and never
/// change; in-game brand names stay altered.</summary>
public static class CarModelMap
{
